<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="GAL" style="id">Galatians</book>
  <para style="h">Galatians</para>
  <para style="toc1">Galatians</para>
  <para style="toc2">Galatians</para>
  <para style="mt">Galatians</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Paula, tirhkoh (mihringte tirh chhuah ni lovin, mihring zârah ni hek lovin, Isua Krista leh mitthi zîng ata a kaithotu Pa Pathian zârah a ni zâwk) leh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />ka hnêna unau awm zawng zawngte chuan Galatia rama kohhranhote hnênah:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Pa Pathian leh kan Lalpa Isua Krista hnên ata khawngaihna leh remna in hnênah awm rawh se;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />ani chuan kan Pathian leh kan Pa remtih zâwngin, tûnlai khawvêl sual tak lakah hian min chhan chhuah theih nân, kan sualte aiah amah a inpe ta;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Pathian hnênah chuan ropuina chatuanin awm rawh se. Amen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Krista khawngaihna zâra a kotu che u kha, chuti thuta Chanchin Ṭha hrang lama in pakaisan hi mak ka ti a ni;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />chu chu Chanchin Ṭha a ni ve si lo; nangmahni tibuaiin, Krista Chanchin Ṭha tihdanglam duh tute emaw an awm mai a ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Nimahsela, keimahniin emaw, vân aṭanga lo chhuk vântirhkoh pawhin emaw, Chanchin Ṭha kan hrilh che u lo kha chu Chanchin Ṭha dang rêng lo hrilh che u sela, ânchhe dawngin awm rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hmâna kan sawi ang khân tûnah ka sawi leh dâwn a ni, “Chanchin Ṭha in pawma lo kha chu, Chanchin Ṭha dang tu pawhin hrilh che u sela, ânchhe dawngin awm rawh se.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mihring tihlâwm nge ka tum, Pathian tihlâwm? Mi zînga tlâktlum tum ka ni em ni? Ni ila, Krista bâwih ka ni lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Chutichuan, unaute u, ka Chanchin Ṭha hril kha mihring lam thu a ni lo tih ka hriattîr a che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mihring hnên ata hmu ka ni lo va, mi min zirtîr ka ni hek lo, Isua Krista inlârna avânga hmu ka ni zâwk si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Juda-te sakhaw biak dânah chuan hmânlaia ka awm dân chu in hre tawh si a, khatia Pathian kohhranho nasa taka tiduhdahin ka tihbuai ṭhin kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, min thlahtute thurochhiah chunga ṭhahnem ka ngaih nasat bîk avângin, Juda-te sakhaw biak dân kawngah chuan ka chite zînga ka rualpui tam takte ka lehpêl ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, ka nu pum chhûng aṭanga mi tihrangtu leh, a khawngaihna avânga mi kotu Pathian chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Jentail-te zînga a Chanchin Ṭha ka hril theih nân a Fapa chu lungni taka ka hnêna a inlârtîr lai khân, tu mah râwn lovin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />tirhkoh ka nih hmaa tirhkoh lo ni tawhte hnênah Jerusalem khuaa han kal hek lovin, Arabia ramah ka kal bo ta nghâl zâwk a; tin, Damaska khuaah ka kîr leh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, kum thum a vei hnuin Kipha kan tûrin Jerusalem khuaah ka han kal a, a hnênah ni sâwm leh ni nga ka châm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tirhkoh dangte erawh chu, Lalpa unau Jakoba chauh lo chu tu mah ka hmu lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />(Ngai teh mah u! In hnêna thu ka ziakte hi Pathian mit hmuhah pawh ka daw lo ve.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Chumi hnuah chuan Suria leh Kilikia ramahte ka lo kal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Nimahsela, Judai ram kohhranho Kristaa awmte hmêlhriat ka la ni lo ta fo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />“Hmâna min tiduhdahtu khân hmâna rinna thu a tihkhawloh ṭhin kha tûnah a hril ta zâwk a ni,” tih mi sawi chauh an hria a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tin, keimah avângin Pathian an chawimawi ta a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, kum sâwm leh kum li a vei hnuin, Tita pawh chu hruai vein, Barnaba rualin Jerusalem khuaah ka han kal leh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, hriattîrna avângin ka han kal a, Jentail-te zînga Chanchin Ṭha ka tlângaupui ṭhin hi anmahni ka han hrilh a; nimahsela, mi lian deuhte chu a hrangin ka hrilh a; chuti lo chuan, a thlâwnin ka tlân hlauh dah ang e, a nih loh leh, tlân thlâwn ka lo ni dah ang e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Nimahsela, Tita ka hnêna awm pawh chu Grik mi ni mah sela, serhtan luihsakin a awm ta lo va;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />chu chu unau der, a rûka an hruai luhte vâng a ni; chûngte chu, bâwiha min siam theih nân, Krista Isuaah chuan zalênna kan neih hi enthla tûrin a rûkin an lût a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nimahsela, Chanchin Ṭha thutak chu in hnêna a awm reng theih nân, dârkâr khat tê pawh intulûtin an thu kan zâwm lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, mi lian deuhva an ruatate lakah chuan (eng ang mi pawh ni sela, ka tân eng mah a lêm chuang lo; Pathianin tu mah thlei bîk a nei si lo va), mi lian deuhva an ruatate chuan eng mah min belhchhah chuang si lo va;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />chutih ahnêkin serhtante Chanchin Ṭha Petera hnêna kawltîra a awm angin, serhtanlohte Chanchin Ṭha ka hnêna kawltîrin a awm tih an hria a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />(Serhtante tirhkoh ni tûrin Petera tâna thawhsaktu ngei chuan, Jentail-te tirhkoh ni tûrin ka tân pawh mi thawhsak si a.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Khawngaihna mi pêka chu an hriat pawhin Jakoba te, Kipha te, Johana te, bana an ruatate chuan keini Jentail-te hnêna kal tûr leh anni zawng serhtante hnêna kal tûrin, kei leh Barnaba chu inpâwlna kut ding lamte min pe ta zâwk mah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Retheite kan hriat reng chauh an duh, chu tak chu tih ka tum tlat rêng ṭhin a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, Kiphaa chu Antiokei khuaa a lo kal laiin demawm taka a awm avângin, a hmaichhan ngeiah ka dodâl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mi tute emaw Jakoba hnên ata an lo kal hma chuan, ani chuan Jentail-te hnênah chaw a ei ṭhîn a; nimahsela, an lo thlen veleh, serhtan mite chu a hlauh avângin, tel leh ta lovin a intihrang ta si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Juda dangte pawh an vervêk ve ta hlawm a; chutichuan, Barnaba meuh pawh an vervêknaa hruai bovin a awm ta hial a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Nimahsela, Chanchin Ṭha thutak angin an awm fel lo tih ka hriatin, Kipha hnênah an zaa hmaah, “Nang Juda mi i ni a, Juda anga awm lovin Jentail angin i awm si a. Engtizia nge Jentail-te chu Juda-te anga awm luihtîr kher i tum?” ka ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Keini zawng Jentail mi sualte ni lovin, Juda mi rênga piang kan ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Nimahsela, Dân thiltihte avângin mi thiam changin a awm lo va, Isua Krista rin avâng chauhvin thiam changin a awm zâwk tih kan hre si a, keini pawhin Dân thiltih avâng ni lovin, Krista rinna avânga thiam changa kan awm theih nân Krista Isua chu kan ring a ni; dân thiltihte avângin mihring rêng rêng thiam changin an awm dâwn si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Kristaah thiam changa awm kan tum chung khân keini ngei pawh mi sual kan lo nih hlauh si chuan, Krista chu sual rawngbâwltu a lo ni em ni? Hnai lo ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ka thil ṭhiatte kha ka sak leh si chuan bawhchhetu ka nih ka inhriattîr mai a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Pathian lam kawnga ka lo nun theih nân, kei zawng Dân avângin Dân lam kawngah ka thi tawh si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Krista hnênah khenbehin ka awm ta; nimahsela, ka nung a ni; keimah erawh chu ka ni tawh lo, Krista chu keimahah a nung zâwk a ni; tin, tûnah tisaa ka nung hi rinnaa nung ka ni - Pathian Fapa, mi hmangaiha ka aia inpetu rinnaah chuan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Pathian khawngaihna chu ka bawh bo lo ve; Dân avânga felna a awm si chuan Krista chu a thlâwnin a thi a ni ang.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aw Galatia rama mi âte u, tuin nge dawi che u? In mit hmuh ngeiah Isua Krista chu khenbehin chiang taka lantîr a nih tehlul nên.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hei chauh hi in hnên ata lo hriat ka duh: Dân thiltihte avângin nge Thlarau chu in hmuh, in ngaihthlâka in rin avângin?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Heti êm hian in â maw? Thlarauva ṭan tawh siin tisain in zo dâwn em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Thil chuti zozai chu sâwtpui lovin in tuar em ni? Sâwtpui loh ni tak tak ta ang sela.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, in hnêna Thlarau petu che u leh in zînga thilmak titu chuan, Dân thiltihte avângin nge a tih, in ngaihthlâka in rin avângin?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Abrahaman Pathian a ring a, tin, chu rinna chu a felnaa ruat a ni ang khân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chutichuan, hre rawh u, rinnaa awmte, chûng ngei chu Abrahama fate an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, Pathian Lehkha Thu chuan, Pathianin rinna avângin Jentail-te thiam a chantîr dâwn tih hre lâwkin, “Nangmahah chuan hnam tin malsâwmsakin an awm ang,” tiin, Abrahama hnênah Chanchin Ṭha chu a hrilh lâwk kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Chutichuan, rinnaa awmte chu Abraham rinawma nên malsâwmin an awm ve ṭhîn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Dân thiltiha awm apiangte chu ânchhe hnuaiah an awm si a; “Dân lehkhabua thu ziak zawng zawng anga ti tûra awm reng lo apiang chu, ânchhe dawngin an awm ṭhîn,” tiin ziak a ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, Pathian mit hmuhin tu mah rêng Dân avânga thiam chang an awm lo tih a lang reng a ni. “Mi felte chu rinnain an nung ang,” tih a ni si a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />tin, Dân chu rinnaa mi a ni lo, “Chûng anga titu chu chûngah chuan a nung ang,” tih a ni zâwk e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Krista chu kan aia ânchhe dawng lo niin, Dân ânchhe lak ata min tlan chhuak ta (“Thinga khai kân apiang chu ânchhe dawng an ni,” tih ziak a ni si a);
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />chutichuan, Abrahama chunga malsâwmna chu Krista Isuaah chuan Jentail-te chungah a lo awm thei ang a; tichuan, rinna avângin Thlarau tiam chu kan hmu thei ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Unaute u, mihring angin ka sawi hi, mihring thuthlung pawh ni mah sela, tihngheh tawh hnuin an phelh ngai lo va, belh pawh an belhchhah ngai hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, Abrahama hnênah a ni thu chu tiamin a awm ni, a chi thlah hnênah pawh. Mi tam tak chung thu sawi angin, “Chi thlahte hnênah pawh,” a ti lo va, mi pakhat chung thu sawi angin, “I chi thlah hnênah pawh,” a ti a ni zâwk e, chu chu Krista hi a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, heti hian ka ti a ni: thuthlung, Pathian lo tihngheh tawh chu, Dân, kum zali leh kum sawmthum hnua lo awm tawh khân, thutiam chu eng mah lova siamin a tibo lo ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ro luah tûr chu Dân avâng a nih chuan thutiam avâng a ni tawh si lo vang; nimahsela, Pathianin thutiam avângin a ni, Abrahama hnênah a pêk ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />A nih loh leh, engtiziaa Dân chu awm nge ni le? Bawhchhiatna hi sual a nih tilang fiah tûra thutiam belhchhahna a ni a, Thutiamin Chi Thlah a tih lo kal hmaa hman tûr, vântirhkohte hmanga palai kuta tihngheh a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, palai rêng rêng mi pakhat lakah palai a ni ngai lo ve, Pathian erawh chu pakhat a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A nih loh leh, Dân chuan Pathian thutiamte chu a dodâl em ni le? Hnai lo ve, Dân, mi tinung thei rêng pêkin a awm tawh si chuan, felna chu Dân avângin a awm ngei tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Nimahsela, Isua Krista rin avânga thil tiam chu a ringtute hnêna pêk a nih theih nân, Pathian Lehkha Thu chuan sual hnuaiah engkim a khârkhip ta vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Nimahsela, rinna a lo thlen hma khân, rinna la lang tûr atân khârkhipa, Dân hnuaia vên kan nih kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Chutichuan, rinna avânga thiam kan chan theihna tûrin, Dân chu Krista hnên lama min kaihruaitu a lo ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Nimahsela, tûnah rinna a lo thlen hnu hian, kaihruaitu hnuaiah kan awm tawh lo ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Krista Isua rin avângin Pathian fate in ni vek si a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />in zînga Kristaa baptisma chang apiangte kha Krista chuan in inthuam tawh si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Chutah chuan Juda mi a awm theih loh va, Grik mi pawh a awm theih hek loh; chutah chuan bâwih a awm theih loh va, bâwih lo pawh a awm theih hek loh; chutah chuan mipa leh hmeichhia pawh a awm theih loh; Krista Isuaah chuan in zain pumkhat in ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tin, Krista ta in nih chuan, Abrahama thlah, thutiam anga roluahtu tûrte in ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Nimahsela, heti hian ka ti a ni: roluahtu tûr chu engkim chungah hotu ni mah sela, naupang a la nih chhûng zawng bâwih nên engah mah a danglam chuang lo ve;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />a pa ruat hun chu a lo thlen hma loh chuan, vêngtu leh enkawltute hnuaiah a awm zâwk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Chutiangin keini pawh naupang kan nih lai khân, khawvêl zirtîrna dik lo hnuaiah bâwihah kan awm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nimahsela, a hun bi a lo kim khân fa nihna kan hmuh theih nân, Dân hnuaia awmte chu tlan tûrin Pathianin a Fapa, hmeichhe hrin, Dân hnuaia lo piangin a tîr chhuak ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, fa in nih avângin Pathianin a Fapa Thlarau chu, “Abba! (Ka pa!)” tia auvin kan thinlungah a rawn tîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chutichuan, bâwih i ni tawh lo va, fa i ni zâwk e; tin, fa i nih chuan Pathian zâra roluahtu tûr i ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Nimahsela, Pathian in hriat loh lai khân, an pianzia rêng pawha Pathian ni hlei lote bâwih in ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tûna Pathian in lo hriat hnu hi zâwngin - ni lo, Pathian mi hriat in lo nih hnu hian, tih tûr a ni zâwk e, khawvêl zirtîrna dik lo, eng mah ni hlei lo, a bâwiha awm leh in châkate lamah chuan engtiziaa hawi kîr leh nge in nih?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ni te, thla te, hun te, kum te in serh ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />In tân tha ka sêng thlâwn dah law maw tih ka hlauhsak a che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Unaute u, ka ngên a che u, keimah angin awm rawh u, kei pawh nangmahni angin ka awm si a. Ka pawi eng mah in khawih lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Chanchin Ṭha in hnêna ka hril hmasak ṭum kha ka tisa chak lohna avâng a ni tih in hre si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, ka tisaa in tân thlêmna awm chu in hmusit lo va, in ten hek lo; Pathian vântirhkoh angin, Krista Isua ang maiin mi lawm tâk zâwk kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Vânnei in intihna kha khawiah nge ni ta le? Tih theih phei chu ni sela, nangnin in mitte kher chhuakin mi pe tawh ang tih ka hriatsak che u asin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Chutichuan, thu dik tak ka hrilh che u avângin in hmêlma ka lo ni ta em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ṭha lamah ni hauh si lovin, ṭhahnemngai takin an zawng chhuak ṭhîn che u a; a ni, anmahni in zawn theih nân pâwn lama khâr hnan che u an duh a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Thu ṭha lamah erawh chuan eng lai pawhin ṭhahnemngai taka zawna awm fo hi a ṭha a ni, in hnêna ka awm lai chauh ni lovin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ka naute u, Krista chu nangmahniah siam puitlina a awm hma loh chuan, nau veiin ka vei leh che u hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A ni, tûnah hian in hnêna awma ka aw tihdanglam ka châk theihzia mai chu! In chung thûah ka mangang si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Dân hnuaia awm duhte u, mi hrilh rawh u, Dân thu chu in ngaithla ṭhîn lâwm ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Heti hian ziak a ni si a: “Abrahaman fapa pahnih a nei a, pakhat chu bâwihnu lakah, pakhat chu bâwih lonu lakah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Nimahsela, bâwihnu laka mi chu tisa dân angin a piang a, bâwih lonu laka mi erawh chu thutiam avângin a piang a ni,” tih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Chûng thu chu tehkhinna a ni; chûng hmeichhiate chu thuthlung pahnih an ni; pakhat chu Sinai tlânga mi, bâwih ni tûra fa hringtu chu; chu chu Hagari a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tin, Hagari hi Arabia rama Sinai tlâng chu a ni a, Jerusalem, tûnlaia awm nên hian ang khat an ni, a fate nên bâwihah an awm si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Chung lam Jerusalem erawh chu bâwih a ni lo va, chu ngei chu keini nu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />“Nang, ching, fa hring ngai lo, hlim rawh; Nang, nau vei ngai lo, au chhuak rawh; Pasal nei mi ai chuan, khawharnu chuan Fate a nei tam zâwk si,” tih ziak a nih kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tichuan, unaute u, keini hi Isaaka ang khân thutiam fate kan ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Nimahsela, chumi lai chuan tisa dâna lo piang chuan Thlarau dâna lo piang chu a tiduhdah ang khân, tûnah pawh chutiang bawk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Nimahsela, Pathian Lehkha Thuin engtin nge a sawi? “Bâwihnu chu a fapa nên hnawt chhuak rawh; bâwihnu fapa chuan bâwih lonu fapa chu ro a luahpui dâwn si lo,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Chutichuan, unaute u, bâwihnu laka fate kan ni lo va, bâwih lonu laka fate kan ni zâwk.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bawih ni lo tûrin Krista chuan min chhuahtîr kha; chutichuan, ding nghet ula, bâwih nghâwngkawlah chuan tâng leh tawh suh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ngai teh u, kei Paulan in hnêna ka sawi hi, serh in tantîr chuan Krista chu in tân eng mah sâwtna a ni lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A ni, Dân thu zawng zawng zâwm tûra batu an ni tih, serh tantîr apiang hnênah ka hriattîr leh a nih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nangni Dâna thiam chan tumte u, Krista nên in inṭhen ta; khawngaihna chu in tlûksan ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Keini zawngin Thlarau zârah rinnain felna beiseina kan nghâk si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Krista Isuaah chuan serhtan eng mah a sâwt lo, serhtan loh pawh eng mah a sâwt hek lo; rinna, hmangaihnaa thawh erawh chu a sâwt a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ṭha takin in tlân ṭhin kha le; thutak chu in zawm loh nân tuin nge dâl ta che u?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />He thlêmna hi a kotu che u hnên ata a ni lo ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Dawidim tlêm têin chhang hlâwm chu a pumin a fan chhuak ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Rilru danglam in pu lo vang tih Lalpaah chuan ka ring tlat a; tibuaitu che u chu tu pawh ni sela, a chunga rorêlna chu a la tuar ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Unaute u, kei hian serhtan thu hril ni ila tihduhdah ka ni cheu dâwn em ni? Chuti ni se kraws thu kan hril hian buaina a siam lo tûr.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tibuaitute che u chu intan fithla law law sela ka duh a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Nangni unaute u, bâwih ni lo tûrin koh in ni si a; nimahsela, in bâwih nih lohna chu tisa tâna remchângah hmang suh ula, hmangaihnain rawng inbâwlsak tawn ṭheuh zâwk rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Nangmah i inhmangaih angin i vêngte i hmangaih tûr a ni,” tih thu kam khatah hian Dân thu zawng zawng chu a famkim tawh a ni si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Nimahsela, in inseha, in inei tawn si chuan, in intihboral tawn loh nân fîmkhur rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Chutichuan, hei hi ka ti a ni: Thlarauvah awm rawh u; tichuan, tisa châkna chu in zâwm dâwn lo nia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tisa hian Thlarau dona lam a châk ṭhîn, Thlarau pawhin tisa dona lam a châk bawk si ṭhîn; thil tih in tumte chu in tih theih loh nân chûngte chu an inkalh si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Nimahsela, Thlarau hruaia in awm chuan Dân hnuaiah chuan in awm lo ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tin, tisa thiltihte chu a lang fiah a ni; chûng chu hêng hi a ni: inngaihna te, bawlhhlawhna te, hurna te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />milem biakna te, dawithiamna te, huatna te, inhauna te, thîkna te, thinurna te, inkhinna te, awm hranna te, rin hranna te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />îtsîkna te, zu ruihna te, zu hmun hlimna te, chutiangte chu; chûng kawngah chuan tûn hmaa, “Chutiang thil tih hmangte chuan Pathian ram an chang lo vang,” tia ka hrilh lâwk che u ang khân ka hrilh lâwk che u hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Thlarau rah erawh chu hmangaihna te, hlimna te, remna te, dawhtheihna te, ngilneihna te, ṭhatna te, rinawmna te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />thuhnuairawlhna te, insûmtheihna te a ni zâwk e; chutiang kalh zâwngin Dân thupêk rêng a awm lo ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tin, Krista Isua mite chuan tisa chu, a sual ngaihtuahna leh a châknate chawpin an khêngbet ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Thlarauva nung kan nih chuan Thlarauvah vêk i awm leh bawk ang u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Incho tawna inîtsîk tawnin, i inngaihlu suh ang u.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Unaute u, mi, sual eng pawh a tih lai phâwkin awm sela, nangni thlarau mite u, “Thlêmna ka tâwk ve dah ang e,” tia invêng ṭha chungin chutiang mi chu thuhnuairawlh takin tungding leh rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />In ritphurhte chu inchhâwk tawn rawh u; chutichuan, Krista dân thu chu in zâwm a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mi, eng mah ni si lovin, mi lian deuhva a inruat chuan mahni a inbum mai a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mi tinin mahni thiltih fiah ṭheuh zâwk rawh se, chumi hunah chuan mi dang chung ni lovin, mahni chung chauhvah chhuan tûr a nei ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mi tinin mahni phur an phur ṭheuh dâwn si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, thu zirtîr dawngtu chuan thil ṭha zawng zawng zirtîrtu hnênah pe ve rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Bumin awm suh u; Pathian chu hmuhsit zia a ni lo ve; miin a theh apiang, chumi vêk chu a seng bawk dâwn si a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />mahni tisa lama thehtu chuan tisaa mi chhiatna a seng ang a; Thlarau lama thehtu erawh chuan Thlarauva mi chatuana nunna a seng dâwn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tichuan, thil ṭha tih i ning suh ang u; kan inthlahdah loh zawngin a hun takah chuan kan seng dâwn si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Chutichuan, hun remchâng kan neih ang zêlin mi zawng zawng chungah thil ṭha i ti ang u, rinna chhûngte zînga mi chungah i ti deuh ber ang u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Keima kut ngeiin in hnênah lehkha hraw pui puia ka ziak hi en rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tisaa hmêl intihmawi duh apiangten serhtana awm tûrin an tîr lui ṭhîn che u a ni; eng mah dang vâng a ni lo va, Krista kraws vânga tihduhdah an tuar loh nân chauh a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Serhtante meuh pawh chuan Dân thu an zâwm chuang si lo va, in taksaah chhuan tûr an neih theih nân serh tantîr che u an duh mai a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Kei erawh chuan kan Lalpa Isua Krista kraws lo chu ka chhuan loh tûrzia mai chu, chumi zârah chuan khawvêl hi ka tân khenbehin a awm ta, kei pawh khawvêl tân khenbehin ka awm a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Siam thar lehna lo chu serhtan hi eng mah a ni lo va, serhtan loh pawh eng mah a ni hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, chumi dân anga awm apiangte chungah chuan remna leh khawngaihna awm rawh se, Pathian Israel-te chungah pawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tûn achinah chuan tu mahin min tibuai tawh suh se; ka taksaah hian Isua chhinchhiahnate ka pu si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Unaute u, Lalpa Isua Krista khawngaihna in thlarau hnênah awm rawh se. Amen.
  </para>
</usx>
